{"event_type":"review","id":"a1558064091364e6a33a37d1c34b90fa0b5f2184968ebf7d1fb317fc80853527","occurred_at":"2026-11-14T22:57:59Z","payload":{"artifacts":[{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/f1ca3a0b6824a71ef531ad4644cbc80ebb88e587889d093b08bdf496368ecaf2","sha256":"f1ca3a0b6824a71ef531ad4644cbc80ebb88e587889d093b08bdf496368ecaf2"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/5a187ea09035881fe5fcf93c6ade9854e926c14dfba0250e393b721de3acec44","sha256":"5a187ea09035881fe5fcf93c6ade9854e926c14dfba0250e393b721de3acec44"},{"kind":"git-bundle","location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/e1f4a9d3c58069f56faba8cb07afd0918782bfceef1ff8527838a384d6f74fb0","sha256":"e1f4a9d3c58069f56faba8cb07afd0918782bfceef1ff8527838a384d6f74fb0"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/b8bcda3fb0809cbbf3bdbaa4d4e42b06c28b06b466033fcebf8db643e88b6721","sha256":"b8bcda3fb0809cbbf3bdbaa4d4e42b06c28b06b466033fcebf8db643e88b6721"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/d2c078b5d2f286330ac22bacd9978a4503143b9fa43e436d80480a0358aefdc3","sha256":"d2c078b5d2f286330ac22bacd9978a4503143b9fa43e436d80480a0358aefdc3"}],"attempt_id":"094a9f3eff8a8c752511b2b7e46c8cdea10337e7765a2f1b14911e32a32133c5:0:1","base":"5136f81137f803daaa4e4451ed5e8de9d81cdce4","completion":{"errors":[],"exit_code":0,"scope_verified":true,"skipped":false,"terminal":true},"findings":[{"anchor_status":"verified","blob":"2f79614439f9750b9257e3ac030a1a54bfc5abac","body":"**Pass existing `JsonNumber` deadlines through without wrapping them again.**\n\n`coreDocument` calls `JsonNumber.float` on `item.aging_deadline`, but `summarize` already stores a `JsonNumber` in that field. `JsonNumber.float` accepts only a `number`, so the call does not type-check. At runtime, the default `raw` argument passes the wrapper object to `pythonNumberText`. That function falls through to `String(value)`, so a deadline of `3600` is stored with the lexeme `[object Object]` instead of `3600.0`. Only plain numbers need the `float` wrapper.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Suggested fix</summary>\n\n```diff\n-    aging_deadline: item.aging_deadline === null ? null : JsonNumber.float(item.aging_deadline),\n+    aging_deadline:\n+      typeof item.aging_deadline === 'number' ? JsonNumber.float(item.aging_deadline) : item.aging_deadline,\n```\n\n</details>","id":"22e61c67d12a0c3c48ced91fbae8188846913445d07fe2daac94f8005ba30b28","intervals":[[400,400]],"path":"src/ops/crq/readOnlyStatus.ts","severity":"major","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Pass existing `JsonNumber` deadlines through without wrapping them again."}],"head":"b0619b1f2c5e706daab3d456203168bd86e19189","head_tree":"e808aac5adf61e3f0f06365372f81340b3333575","input_scope":[{"blob":"2f79614439f9750b9257e3ac030a1a54bfc5abac","intervals":[[1,457]],"path":"src/ops/crq/readOnlyStatus.ts"},{"blob":"487958d84e0d56091995febbf34c7d4e136328e2","intervals":[[1,30]],"path":"src/ops/crq/registry.ts"}],"job_id":"094a9f3eff8a8c752511b2b7e46c8cdea10337e7765a2f1b14911e32a32133c5:0","outcome":"completed","paths":[{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"path cluster"},"blob":"2f79614439f9750b9257e3ac030a1a54bfc5abac","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"src/ops/crq/readOnlyStatus.ts","reason":"bounded verified input"},{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"path cluster"},"blob":"487958d84e0d56091995febbf34c7d4e136328e2","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"src/ops/crq/registry.ts","reason":"bounded verified input"}],"policy_digest":"eacd1bcf42a0e72eca72fcf9c1e9c8f97e7c515cd67a8fa7965c966924647693","repo":"camerontaylor/cq-toolkit","requested_scope":[{"blob":"2f79614439f9750b9257e3ac030a1a54bfc5abac","intervals":[[1,457]],"path":"src/ops/crq/readOnlyStatus.ts"},{"blob":"487958d84e0d56091995febbf34c7d4e136328e2","intervals":[[1,30]],"path":"src/ops/crq/registry.ts"}],"reviewed_scope":[{"blob":"2f79614439f